    "detailed_description": "<strong>Mannequin is a short first person horror game where you navigate through a store filled with suspicious dolls as you step into the shoes of a clothing store worker. </strong><br><br>However, as you make your way towards the exit, a flickering of lights precedes a complete power outage, plunging the store into darkness and leaving you trapped inside.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/c6c6cfc5c454aadcd9931894edb278c1.poster.avif?t=1696381575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/c6c6cfc5c454aadcd9931894edb278c1.webm?t=1696381575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/c6c6cfc5c454aadcd9931894edb278c1.mp4?t=1696381575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Try to survive while you make your way through the store and try to find a way out.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/14f352a2878bc03a610157f50e1f6d00.poster.avif?t=1696381575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/14f352a2878bc03a610157f50e1f6d00.webm?t=1696381575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/14f352a2878bc03a610157f50e1f6d00.mp4?t=1696381575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you cautiously tread through the store's eerily quiet aisles you'll need to watch your back because each time you avert your gaze, they inch closer, their cold plastic hands reaching out to grasp you. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/a36b8bcb042ae69057bf4d5e47e4e284.poster.avif?t=1696381575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/a36b8bcb042ae69057bf4d5e47e4e284.webm?t=1696381575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/a36b8bcb042ae69057bf4d5e47e4e284.mp4?t=1696381575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Using your phone as flashlight<br></li><li>Murderous dolls are chasing you<br></li><li>Chilling Atmosphere<br></li><li>A short thrilling experience <br></li><li>Nerve-wracking sounds<br></li><li>Surprise twist<br></li><li>Unexpected environment</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/bf5073e184ed3523e23bb46013227b99.poster.avif?t=1696381575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/bf5073e184ed3523e23bb46013227b99.webm?t=1696381575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488630/extras/bf5073e184ed3523e23bb46013227b99.mp4?t=1696381575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>WASD to move <br></li><li>Mouse to Look<br></li><li>F to use flashlight<br></li><li>E to interact<br></li><li>Shift to sprint<br></li><li>ESC to Pause/UnPause</li></ul>",
